<<
/AP <<
/N 87 0 R
>>
/BS <<
/W 0
>>
/Contents (Para aproveitar melhor a\ratividade ao lado, plote \rno Geogebra a funÁ„o \rf\(x\) = log2\(x\), crie um\rcontrole deslizante com \ruma vari·vel a e, em\rseguida, plote a funÁ„o\rg\(x\)= a + log2\(x\). \rEnt„o, variando o valor de\ra, vocÍ poder· entender \rqual efeito este termo\rtem sobre o gr·fico da \rfunÁ„o.\r\rDepois, para o item c, \rcrie outro controle \rdeslizante b e plote\ro gr·fico de \rh\(x\) = log2\(x+b\). Varie\rb e veja o que ocorre \rcom o gr·fico.\r\rEste È o tipo de atividade\rque vocÍ deve explorar com\rseus alunos no laboratÛrio\rde inform·tica.)
/CreationDate (D:20151012161618-03'00')
/DA (0 0 0 rg /F1 12 Tf)
/DS (font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;)
/F 4
/IT /FreeTextTypewriter
/M (D:20151012162204-03'00')
/NM (654d4eab-6d43-4e08-8ea734e4f81d2fe6)
/P 11 0 R
/RC (<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:10.1.5" xfa:spec="2.0.2" style="text-align:left;line-height:normal;font-family:Courier New;font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:#000000;text-valign:top;"><p style="color:#FF0000;"><span>Para&#32;aproveitar&#32;melhor&#32;a&#13;</span><span>atividade&#32;ao&#32;lado,&#32;plote&#32;&#13;</span><span>no&#32;Geogebra&#32;a&#32;fun&#231;&#227;o&#32;&#13;</span><span>f\(x\)&#32;=&#32;log</span><span style="font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><sub>2</sub></span><span>\(x\),&#32;crie&#32;um&#13;</span><span>controle&#32;deslizante&#32;com&#32;&#13;</span><span>uma&#32;vari&#225;vel&#32;a&#32;e,&#32;em&#13;</span><span>seguida,&#32;plote&#32;a&#32;fun&#231;&#227;o&#13;</span><span>g\(x\)=&#32;a&#32;+&#32;log</span><span style="font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><sub>2\(</sub></span><span>x\).&#32;&#13;</span><span>Ent&#227;o,&#32;variando&#32;o&#32;valor&#32;de&#13;</span><span>a,&#32;voc&#234;&#32;poder&#225;&#32;entender&#32;&#13;</span><span>qual&#32;efeito&#32;este&#32;termo&#13;</span><span>tem&#32;sobre&#32;o&#32;gr&#225;fico&#32;da&#32;&#13;</span><span>fun&#231;&#227;o.&#13;&#13;</span><span>Depois,&#32;para&#32;o&#32;item&#32;c,&#32;&#13;</span><span>crie&#32;outro&#32;controle&#32;&#13;</span><span>deslizante&#32;b&#32;e&#32;plote&#13;</span><span>o&#32;gr&#225;fico&#32;de&#32;&#13;</span><span>h\(x\)&#32;=&#32;log</span><span style="font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><sub>2</sub></span><span>\(x+b\).&#32;Varie&#13;</span><span>b&#32;e&#32;veja&#32;o&#32;que&#32;ocorre&#32;&#13;</span><span>com&#32;o&#32;gr&#225;fico.&#13;&#13;</span><span>Este&#32;&#233;&#32;o&#32;tipo&#32;de&#32;atividade&#13;</span><span>que&#32;voc&#234;&#32;deve&#32;explorar&#32;com&#13;</span><span>seus&#32;alunos&#32;no&#32;laborat&#243;rio&#13;</span><span>de&#32;inform&#225;tica.</span></p></body>)
/Rect [13.505686 286.084351 200.705704 641.308472]
/Subj (M·quina de Escrever)
/Subtype /FreeText
/T (Anne)
/Type /Annot
>>
endobj
